<title>USA: Allied Digital extends warrant expiration.</title>
<headline>Allied Digital extends warrant expiration.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Digital Technologies Corp said it extended the expiration date of its class A and B redeemable warrants for one year.</p>
<p>The expiration date is now July 28, 1997.</p>
<p>Allied Digital said the terms and conditions on the warrants will remain the same.</p>
</text>
